{"seq":3,"slug":"recommendation-explanation-feedback-loop","title":"推荐解释、信任与反馈闭环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/apparel-size-fit-recommendation-returns-reduction/tryon-guidance-ux/recommendation-explanation-feedback-loop","wordCount":2993,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"推荐解释-信任与反馈闭环\">推荐解释、信任与反馈闭环</h1><p>同样推荐 M 码，一句「你的肩宽 42 cm 落在 M 码范围内」和一句「智能算法为你精选」在转化率上可能都有效，但在退货率上走向相反：前者把不确定性摊开让用户自己判断，后者把它藏进权威语气，收货后发现不合身时，损失的不只是这一单，还有对整个尺码系统的信任。NRF 与 Happy Returns 的《2025 Retail Returns Landscape》估算 2025 年美国零售退货总额约 8499 亿美元、线上销售退货率约 19.3%（来源：NRF, 2025 Retail Returns Landscape），服饰鞋类因线上无法试穿长期高于均值。本文处理推荐结果「怎么讲」与「怎么从收货结果里学回来」；输入画像采集见《<a href=\"fit-quiz-body-profile-capture\">合身问答与体型画像采集</a>》，推荐与试穿图分工见《<a href=\"virtual-tryon-recommendation-interaction\">虚拟试穿与尺码推荐交互</a>》，偏差量化校正见《<a href=\"../size-data-fit-model/fit-model-evaluation-bias-correction\">合身模型评估与偏差校正</a>》。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-校准信任而非抬升采纳\">核心概念：校准信任而非抬升采纳</h2><p>把解释当说服工具，是这套系统最常见的设计错误。推荐输出是一个概率，用户要做的是把「系统说 78% 合身」翻译成「我该不该下单」——解释要降低的是<strong>决策相关的不确定性</strong>，采纳率只是副产品。把低置信度推荐讲得和高置信度一样斩钉截铁，短期采纳上升、长期退货同步上升。</p>\n<p>合格与否看<strong>信任校准（trust calibration）</strong>：用户对推荐的信任是否与推荐实际可靠度匹配。校准误差用期望校准误差度量——把预测概率分箱，比较每箱的平均预测概率与实测合身率：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover><mfrac><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">∣</mo><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">∣</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{ECE} = \\sum_{k=1}^{K} \\frac{n_k}{N}\\,\\bigl|\\,\\mathrm{acc}(B_k) - \\mathrm{conf}(B_k)\\,\\bigr|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">ECE</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1304em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.2em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.2em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1200\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v0 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v0 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v0 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">acc</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.0778em;\">conf</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.2em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.2em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1200\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v0 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v0 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v0 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个概率箱，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是其样本数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{acc}(B_k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">acc</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是该箱实测合身比例，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{conf}(B_k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.0778em;\">conf</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是该箱平均预测概率。一个 ECE 高的模型配上「非常合身」的文案，比一个 ECE 高但话术谨慎的模型危险得多。人与 AI 协作的对照实验（Bansal 等, CHI 2021）反复观察到：解释在提升准确率之前先提升<strong>依赖倾向</strong>——它让人更愿意相信，却不必然让人判断得更准。因此验收指标必须同时含校准误差与退货率。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>解释形态</th>\n<th>直接目标</th>\n<th>用户行为改变</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>权威断言（「算法推荐 M」）</td>\n<td>采纳率</td>\n<td>更快下单</td>\n<td>过度信任，退货率上升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特征归因（「肩宽决定选 M」）</td>\n<td>可理解性</td>\n<td>自行核对</td>\n<td>归因错误时误导</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反事实（「胸围小 3 cm 则选 S」）</td>\n<td>边界认知</td>\n<td>理解相邻码差异</td>\n<td>需用户知道自身数值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分布呈现（整条尺码条 + 置信度）</td>\n<td>校准</td>\n<td>按风险自选</td>\n<td>信息过载，决策变慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>诚实弃权（「数据不足，建议看尺码表」）</td>\n<td>避免错误推荐</td>\n<td>回退人工判断</td>\n<td>短期转化下降</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行最容易被产品侧砍掉，却是长期退货率的关键闸门。当画像只有身高体重、商品又是版型敏感的西装外套时，承认「拿不准」比给出一个 55% 的推荐更负责——回到尺码表的用户至少不会因为相信系统而误购。工程上落到三条不可让步的约束：置信度必须可见（低置信度不得与高置信度共用斩钉截铁的话术）、弃权必须是合法出口（不被产品指标惩罚）、解释不得制造虚假确定性（归因错误比没有解释更糟）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解释的三种可交付形态\">解释的三种可交付形态</h2><p>要生成的不只是一段文案，而是一份<strong>结构化的解释对象</strong>，前端据设备、语言与用户状态渲染成不同形态。</p>\n<p><strong>特征归因</strong>回答「为什么是这个码」。把合身判定的对数几率拆成各身体维度的贡献：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>fit</mtext><mo>∣</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>fit</mtext><mo>∣</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>维度 </mtext><mi>j</mi><mtext> 的贡献</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log\\frac{p(\\text{fit}\\mid s)}{1-p(\\text{fit}\\mid s)} = b_0 + \\sum_{j} \\phi_j, \\qquad \\phi_j = \\text{维度 } j \\text{ 的贡献}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fit</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fit</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4638em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">维度</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">的贡献</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为正表示该维度支持当前码，为负表示反对；取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\phi_j|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 最大的维度作解释主句（「主要看肩宽」）。加法模型上该拆解精确；梯度提升或深度模型上需用 Shapley 值近似（Lundberg 与 Lee, 2017 的 SHAP 是常用实现），并把近似误差控制在文案容忍范围内。</p>\n<p><strong>反事实</strong>回答「差在哪里」。给出「若胸围再小 3 cm 就该选 S」这类最小改动建议，把用户的测量不确定性与码边界对齐（Wachter 等, 2017 的「不打开黑箱的反事实解释」正是此思路）。</p>\n<p><strong>分布呈现</strong>回答「有多确定」。把整条尺码条按合身概率排序展示，让相邻码的差距可见——弹性针织的相邻码概率接近，定制西装的相邻码概率断崖。这与《<a href=\"virtual-tryon-recommendation-interaction\">虚拟试穿与尺码推荐交互</a>》中温度参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 编码的品类容错度是同一份数据。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;推荐服务&lt;br/&gt;码概率+归因+反事实&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;画像完整性&quot;}&#10;  B --&gt;|体围齐全| C[&quot;完整解释&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt;|仅身高体重| D[&quot;降级解释+弃权提示&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt;|无画像| E[&quot;仅尺码表&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; F[&quot;前端渲染&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[&quot;用户决策&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt; H[&quot;收货反馈回流&quot;]&#10;  H --&gt; I[&quot;校准误差重估&quot;]&#10;  I --&gt; A\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"推荐服务&lt;br/&gt;码概率+归因+反事实\"] --&gt; B{\"画像完整性\"}\n  B --&gt;|体围齐全| C[\"完整解释\"]\n  B --&gt;|仅身高体重| D[\"降级解释+弃权提示\"]\n  B --&gt;|无画像| E[\"仅尺码表\"]\n  C --&gt; F[\"前端渲染\"]\n  D --&gt; F\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[\"用户决策\"]\n  G --&gt; H[\"收货反馈回流\"]\n  H --&gt; I[\"校准误差重估\"]\n  I --&gt; A</pre><p>一个易被忽略的本地化约束：解释文案嵌着数值与尺码系统。同一件衬衫在德国站标 <code>38</code>、美国站标 <code>M</code>、日本站标 <code>M</code>，必须把用户所处尺码系统当作显式输入，否则「你平时穿的 M 对应本款 L」这类跨系统映射句会系统性讲错。尺码字段如何结构化成语义可比的度量，见《<a href=\"../product-attribute-size-ontology/apparel-size-ontology-schema\">服装尺码本体与属性 Schema 设计</a>》。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从过度信任到弃权-信任状态的运营\">从过度信任到弃权：信任状态的运营</h2><p>信任不是单调越好。分成三档各自设计干预，比笼统追求「更高的信任」更可操作。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信任状态</th>\n<th>观测信号</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n<th>干预</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>信任不足</td>\n<td>有推荐仍手动查尺码表、反复切换码</td>\n<td>转化低，退货也低</td>\n<td>展示归因与置信度，降低决策成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信任校准</td>\n<td>采纳率与实测合身率一致</td>\n<td>退货率随模型提升而下降</td>\n<td>保持，持续监控 ECE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过度信任</td>\n<td>高采纳率 + 高「尺码不合适」退货</td>\n<td>退货成本上升，信任反噬</td>\n<td>提高弃权阈值，显式标注低置信度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>识别过度信任的信号很具体：采纳率显著高于基线，同时退货原因里「尺码不合适」占比同步上升。此时正确的动作不是继续优化说服力，而是<strong>把置信度显示出来</strong>并放宽弃权阈值。微软 HAX Toolkit 与 Google PAIR 的《People + AI Guidebook》都把「让用户知道系统何时不确定」列为首要设计原则——这是退货成本结构的推论。</p>\n<p>对高风险品类（定制西装、大码女装、泳装）应降低自动化程度：给出推荐但强制确认关键维度，或直接引导到尺码表。GDPR 第 22 条限制对个人产生法律或类似重大影响的纯自动化决策，并要求提供有意义的信息说明与人工介入途径；尺码推荐通常不构成「重大影响」，但解释与异议机制在设计上应能平滑满足该要求。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反馈闭环-从收货到回流\">反馈闭环：从收货到回流</h2><p>推荐系统真正的学习信号不在点击里，而在收货之后。把这条闭环拆开，每一环都有丢失与延迟。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;推荐曝光&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;用户下单&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;物流签收&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D{&quot;用户反馈&quot;}&#10;  D --&gt;|保留| E[&quot;正样本 keep&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt;|退货·尺码| F[&quot;负样本 return:size&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt;|换码| G[&quot;强负样本 exchange&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt;|无反馈| H[&quot;删失 censored&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; I[&quot;训练标签集&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; I&#10;  G --&gt; I&#10;  H --&gt; J[&quot;不入监督信号&quot;]&#10;  I --&gt; K[&quot;模型重训&quot;]&#10;  K --&gt; A\">graph TD\n  A[\"推荐曝光\"] --&gt; B[\"用户下单\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"物流签收\"]\n  C --&gt; D{\"用户反馈\"}\n  D --&gt;|保留| E[\"正样本 keep\"]\n  D --&gt;|退货·尺码| F[\"负样本 return:size\"]\n  D --&gt;|换码| G[\"强负样本 exchange\"]\n  D --&gt;|无反馈| H[\"删失 censored\"]\n  E --&gt; I[\"训练标签集\"]\n  F --&gt; I\n  G --&gt; I\n  H --&gt; J[\"不入监督信号\"]\n  I --&gt; K[\"模型重训\"]\n  K --&gt; A</pre><p>三条反馈通道的工程属性差异极大，混用会污染标签。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>通道</th>\n<th>覆盖率</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n<th>主要偏差</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>显式「合身吗」问卷</td>\n<td>低（个位数百分比）</td>\n<td>收货后数天</td>\n<td>自选择偏差，极端体验者更愿答</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退货原因标签</td>\n<td>中（仅退货单）</td>\n<td>14–30 天</td>\n<td>只见负样本，无正样本对照</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>换货记录</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>14–30 天</td>\n<td>强信号但稀疏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>评论正文</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>数周</td>\n<td>需 NLP 抽取，噪声高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键的统计问题是<strong>删失（censoring）</strong>：只有下单并被签收的商品才有标签，未下单的永远没有「这件是否合身」的真值。直接拿退货率训练会得到「推荐越保守、退货越低」的退化结论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"闭环的三个陷阱与反制\">闭环的三个陷阱与反制</h2><p>第一是<strong>曝光偏差（exposure bias）</strong>。用户大概率采纳了推荐的码，于是「实际下单的码」与「推荐的码」高度相关，标签无法区分「这个码本来就对」与「用户被引导才选它」。反制是<strong>保留一条随机化曝光</strong>：对小比例流量给出均匀随机的码或跳过推荐，用这部分数据无偏估计各码真实合身率，再用逆倾向得分（IPS）给全量数据加权：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>R</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mtext>IPS</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>π</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{R}_{\\text{IPS}} = \\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{i=1}^{N} \\frac{r_i \\cdot \\mathbb{1}[s_i = \\pi(a_i)]}{p_{\\pi}(a_i \\mid x_i)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0968em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">IPS</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.106em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是实际展示的码，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span> 是待评估策略，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>π</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\pi}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该策略选择该码的概率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是回报（合身 1、退货 0），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是用户实际选的码。缺少这条随机化通道，任何「新策略更好」的结论都可能只是曝光分布变了。</p>\n<p>第二是<strong>延迟反馈的时间错位</strong>。退货标签要等 14–30 天，若用「已到期标签」训练，评测集里最近样本全是合身的。工程上要么按标签成熟度做样本加权，要么用延迟反馈建模估计尚未到期样本的结局，并与 CUPED 等方差缩减技术配合，才能在有限 A/B 流量里测出微小提升。</p>\n<p>第三是<strong>幸存者偏差的正样本缺失</strong>。退货单有明确负标签，保留单却常常没有，因为它们没触发任何流程。补救是把「签收后 N 天未发起退货」视为弱正样本并标注不确定度，而不是当作确定的 keep。</p>\n<p>合规层面还有一道硬约束：GDPR 第 13–15 条要求告知处理目的与逻辑、第 17 条要求可删除；《数字服务法》（EU DSA, Regulation (EU) 2022/2065）第 27 条要求平台披露推荐系统主要参数，若参数含体型数据，披露与可解释义务会叠加。美国 FTC 亦从《FTC 法案》第 5 条的反欺骗角度约束对 AI 能力的夸大表述（FTC 2022 年《Bringing Dark Patterns to Light》报告）——解释文案不得制造虚假确定性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"上线度量与门控\">上线度量与门控</h2><p>解释与闭环的改动必须有独立于推荐模型的度量口径，否则无法归因。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>口径</th>\n<th>角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ECE</td>\n<td>分箱预测概率与实测合身率之差</td>\n<td>主指标（校准）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>采纳率</td>\n<td>下单码 = 推荐码的比例</td>\n<td>过程指标，非目标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尺码相关退货率</td>\n<td>退货原因含 size 的退货 / 签收单</td>\n<td>主指标（成本）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>换码率</td>\n<td>换码单 / 签收单</td>\n<td>强负信号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解释展开率</td>\n<td>用户点开「为什么推荐」的比例</td>\n<td>诊断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>弃权触发率</td>\n<td>走弃权路径的会话比例</td>\n<td>诊断，过高说明画像覆盖不足</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>门控流程固定：先在保留随机曝光的小流量上验证解释不降低校准误差，再放大；把尺码相关退货率设为<strong>护栏指标</strong>，一旦超过基线就回滚。只报采纳率收益、不报退货率变化的评测，不足以支持全量发布。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>解释层的目标是<strong>信任校准</strong>，不是采纳率；ECE 与尺码相关退货率是主指标，采纳率只是过程指标。</li>\n<li>可交付的解释对象由三部分构成：特征归因（SHAP 拆解）、反事实（最小改动建议）、分布呈现（整条尺码条 + 置信度）。</li>\n<li>信任要分档运营：信任不足补可理解性，过度信任提高弃权阈值并显式标注低置信度，高风险品类降低自动化程度。</li>\n<li>闭环的三个陷阱是曝光偏差、延迟反馈错位与正样本缺失；反制分别是保留随机曝光 + IPS 加权、按标签成熟度加权、以「签收后 N 天未退货」作弱正样本。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"推荐解释、信任与反馈闭环","id":"推荐解释-信任与反馈闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：校准信任而非抬升采纳","id":"核心概念-校准信任而非抬升采纳"},{"level":2,"text":"解释的三种可交付形态","id":"解释的三种可交付形态"},{"level":2,"text":"从过度信任到弃权：信任状态的运营","id":"从过度信任到弃权-信任状态的运营"},{"level":2,"text":"反馈闭环：从收货到回流","id":"反馈闭环-从收货到回流"},{"level":2,"text":"闭环的三个陷阱与反制","id":"闭环的三个陷阱与反制"},{"level":2,"text":"上线度量与门控","id":"上线度量与门控"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"虚拟试穿与尺码推荐交互","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/apparel-size-fit-recommendation-returns-reduction/tryon-guidance-ux/virtual-tryon-recommendation-interaction"},"next":{"title":"尺码相关退货归因与度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/apparel-size-fit-recommendation-returns-reduction/returns-reduction-operations/size-return-attribution-metrics"}}